00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:13.780
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:20.386
As we slowly emerge from
the grip of one deadly plague

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:23.022
that's ravaged the country for
the past year, the coronavirus,

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.490
