00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:31.430
And in both cases,
there's been a small minority

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:34.233
of sociopaths with outsized
power in our politics

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:35.768
who stand in the way
whenever the rest of us

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:37.069
