00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:39.806
They've been too busy
melting down about Dr. Seuss

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.774
or the Looney Tunes
or Potato Head dolls.

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:43.276
Next, they're gonna
start whining

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.979
