is trying to outlaw PEZ.

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:48.314
You can have
my Spider-Man dispenser

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.950
when you pry it
from my cold, dead hands!

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:52.852
Not my PEZ-ident!

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:55.354
In fact, on Monday,
