on the ground.

00:01:16.875 --> 00:01:19.612
We'll bring you the details
as they emerge tonight.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:22.048
We start tonight
and turn to Joe Biden,

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:25.585
who after falling not once,
