00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:37.850
I mean, look at this.
That's insane.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.119
I don't care
how you feel about guns.

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:42.321
Casually showing off a bunch
of killing machines

00:03:42.321 --> 00:03:43.756
like this is demented.

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:47.660
If I accidentally found a room
like this at a dinner party,

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.995
I would make an excuse
