00:03:49.995 --> 00:03:51.864
"Did you find
the bathroom okay?"

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:53.199
"Uh, you know, I did.

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:54.900
Also, honey,
the babysitter called,

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:56.735
and the boys are not feeling
well, so we should --"

00:03:56.735 --> 00:04:00.606
"Oh, no, you went right
