long-lost documents.

00:08:19.031 --> 00:08:21.366
[ As Nicolas Cage ] The
Constitution says yes on guns,

00:08:21.366 --> 00:08:25.304
and I was given up for adoption
by a velociraptor.

00:08:25.304 --> 00:08:28.273
And, yeah,
I know my current haircut

00:08:28.273 --> 00:08:31.077
looks like Samberg's
Nic Cage wig.

00:08:33.412 --> 00:08:35.914
[ Normal voice ]
Again, as Warren Burger put it,
it's a fraud.

00:08:35.914 --> 00:08:37.983
And, of course, the NRA
is no stranger to fraud,

00:08:37.983 --> 00:08:39.885
given that it is
currently bankrupt

00:08:39.885 --> 00:08:41.987
