pursues a fraud case

00:08:41.987 --> 00:08:43.455
against the organization.

00:08:43.455 --> 00:08:46.759
NRA officials allegedly conned
their members out of millions

00:08:46.759 --> 00:08:48.794
by fundraising off
the Second Amendment

00:08:48.794 --> 00:08:51.664
and then using that money on,
among other things...

00:09:01.006 --> 00:09:02.708
These guys treated
the NRA bank account

00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:03.976
like it was
the Showcase Showdown

00:09:03.976 --> 00:09:04.977
on "The Price Is Right."

00:09:04.977 --> 00:09:06.178
The simple fact is,

00:09:06.178 --> 00:09:08.013
it is too easy to get a gun
in this country

00:09:08.013 --> 00:09:09.081
and we have
far too many of them.

00:09:09.081 --> 00:09:10.249
Keep in mind that the U.S.

00:09:10.249 --> 00:09:12.551
has about 4%
of the world's population,

00:09:12.551 --> 00:09:13.853
and yet it also has...

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.332
And I appreciate that they
crunched the numbers,

00:09:26.332 --> 00:09:27.600
but the fact that we even need

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:29.835
a sophisticated
statistical analysis

00:09:29.835 --> 00:09:32.171
to tell us there's a connection
between how many guns we have

00:09:32.171 --> 00:09:34.240
and how many gun deaths we have
is insane.

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.507
If you eat a bunch of chili dogs

00:09:35.507 --> 00:09:37.276
and then ride the Cyclone
for an hour,

00:09:37.276 --> 00:09:38.844
you don't need
a quantum physicist

00:09:38.844 --> 00:09:40.813
to tell you why you barfed
all over your date.

00:09:40.813 --> 00:09:43.415
Maybe it's because I get nervous
around the opposite sex?

00:09:43.415 --> 00:09:44.784
That's not it, pal.

00:09:44.784 --> 00:09:47.686
There is a very obvious
connection here.

00:09:47.686 --> 00:09:50.289
Every analysis, every graph
correlating guns and gun deaths

00:09:50.289 --> 00:09:51.590
tells us that.

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:53.426
And there are proven solutions
we could implement.

00:09:53.426 --> 00:09:56.828
Famously, Australia
confiscated 650,000 guns.

00:09:56.828 --> 00:09:58.564
Murders and suicides plummeted.

00:09:58.564 --> 00:09:59.598
And yet every time another one

00:09:59.598 --> 00:10:00.866
of these horrific
shootings happen,

00:10:00.866 --> 00:10:03.201
the same awful ritual plays out.

00:10:03.201 --> 00:10:05.004
The overwhelming majority
of Americans

00:10:05.004 --> 00:10:07.873
