gun safety measures,

00:10:07.873 --> 00:10:10.876
like universal background
checks, mandatory gun licenses,

00:10:10.876 --> 00:10:12.311
or a ban on assault weapons.

00:10:12.311 --> 00:10:13.746
And then there's the other hand,

00:10:13.746 --> 00:10:16.582
