of callous sociopaths,

00:10:16.582 --> 00:10:19.018
who lose their minds
at even the suggestion

00:10:19.018 --> 00:10:21.553
that we should maybe make it
just a little harder

00:10:21.553 --> 00:10:23.089
to buy a gun in this country.

00:10:23.089 --> 00:10:27.192
-Every time there's a shooting,
we play this ridiculous theater

00:10:27.192 --> 00:10:31.130
