00:10:47.279 --> 00:10:49.915
after you jetted off to Cancún
during a deadly blackout,

00:10:49.915 --> 00:10:53.052
then flew back for a photo op
where you handed out water,

00:10:53.052 --> 00:10:55.187
then jetted off again to Orlando

00:10:55.187 --> 00:10:57.289
for the Conservative
Political Action Conference.

00:10:57.289 --> 00:10:59.391
That photo op was
such ridiculous theater,

00:10:59.391 --> 00:11:01.560
I'm shocked you didn't
get cast on Broadway.

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:03.362
Tonight, the role
of Mr. Mistoffelees

00:11:03.362 --> 00:11:05.431
will be played by Ted Cruz!

00:11:05.431 --> 00:11:09.634
And the good news is, even that
wouldn't make "Cats" any worse.

00:11:09.634 --> 00:11:12.704
And, by the way, these guys
don't even have a coherent logic

00:11:12.704 --> 00:11:14.673
for why they oppose
gun safety measures

00:11:14.673 --> 00:11:16.641
supported by the vast majority
of Americans.

00:11:16.641 --> 00:11:19.210
Just listen to Louisiana senator
John Kennedy

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.781
accidentally make the argument
for gun safety reforms

00:11:22.781 --> 00:11:24.049
at yesterday's hearing.

00:11:24.049 --> 00:11:27.920
-I'm not trying to perfectly
equate these two, but...

00:11:30.456 --> 00:11:33.525
We have a lot
of drunk drivers in America

00:11:33.525 --> 00:11:35.327
that kill a lot of people.

00:11:37.162 --> 00:11:40.166
We ought to -- We ought to try
to combat that, too.

00:11:42.067 --> 00:11:45.304
But I think what many folks on
my side of the aisle are saying

00:11:45.304 --> 00:11:49.341
is that the answer is not to
get rid of all sober drivers.

00:11:49.341 --> 00:11:50.543
-Great idea, Senator.

00:11:50.543 --> 00:11:52.211
Let's treat guns
like automobiles.

00:11:52.211 --> 00:11:54.246
You have to take a test
and get a license

00:11:54.246 --> 00:11:55.447
before you can use one.

00:11:55.447 --> 00:11:57.283
You have to register it
with the government,

00:11:57.283 --> 00:12:00.352
and the cops can take it away
if you use it irresponsibly

00:12:00.352 --> 00:12:02.588
or if you leave it on
the wrong side of the street

00:12:02.588 --> 00:12:04.723
from 9:30 to 11:00 a.m.
on Thursdays.

00:12:04.723 --> 00:12:07.159
Imagine if every time
you accidentally committed

00:12:07.159 --> 00:12:10.595
even the tiniest infraction with
a gun they towed it like a car

00:12:10.595 --> 00:12:13.298
and the only way to get it back
was to take the F train

00:12:13.298 --> 00:12:15.668
down to a lot in a part of
Brooklyn you've never heard of

00:12:15.668 --> 00:12:17.470
called East Coney Island Heights

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:20.739
that only exists for like one
magical week every 100 years

00:12:20.739 --> 00:12:24.009
and then pay a $1,000 fine
to a guy in a tiny booth

00:12:24.009 --> 00:12:26.378
who only accepts euros
or camel cash

00:12:26.378 --> 00:12:27.880
and doesn't seem
to have any sympathy

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:29.681
for the fact that you were
only parked illegally

00:12:29.681 --> 00:12:32.451
for five minutes to run into
the only goddamn café

00:12:32.451 --> 00:12:34.153
in New York City
that makes a matcha latte

00:12:34.153 --> 00:12:36.622
up to your wife's
impossible standards.

00:12:36.622 --> 00:12:38.424
"Buddy!

00:12:38.424 --> 00:12:40.358
Buddy, can you hear me?

00:12:40.358 --> 00:12:42.595
Can you hear me
through the glass?

00:12:44.096 --> 00:12:46.731
Buddy!"

00:12:46.731 --> 00:12:49.434
Most gun owners would be like,
"Forget it. Keep my gun."

00:12:49.434 --> 00:12:52.371
But there you go -- Kennedy said
let's treat guns like cars.

00:12:52.371 --> 00:12:53.605
Fine by me.

00:12:53.605 --> 00:12:55.874
Introduce your legislation
and let's get it passed.

00:12:55.874 --> 00:12:57.743
Of course, it won't surprise you
to learn

00:12:57.743 --> 00:12:59.712
that he immediately
backed off that

00:12:59.712 --> 00:13:02.614
and downgraded to a new,
dumber proposal.

00:13:02.614 --> 00:13:06.085
-In my judgment, we do not need
more gun control.

00:13:06.085 --> 00:13:08.687
We need more idiot control.

00:13:08.687 --> 00:13:11.757
-You know, your fake folksy
schtick isn't fooling anyone.

00:13:11.757 --> 00:13:13.158
This guy went to Oxford,

00:13:13.158 --> 00:13:16.228
so when he comes out hee-hawing
and chewing on a weed,

00:13:16.228 --> 00:13:18.397
it's a little like watching
Damian Lewis in "Billions."

00:13:18.397 --> 00:13:19.765
We know you're British.

00:13:19.765 --> 00:13:22.301
You can eat as much pizza pie
as you like.

00:13:22.301 --> 00:13:23.968
We know you're British.

00:13:23.968 --> 00:13:25.403
And you're wonderful.

00:13:25.403 --> 00:13:27.406
But if you really think
we need idiot control,

00:13:27.406 --> 00:13:29.341
how about we start with
the party that elected the guy

00:13:29.341 --> 00:13:30.842
who thought you could
cure coronavirus

00:13:30.842 --> 00:13:32.911
by shooting bleach up your nose
with a turkey baster

00:13:32.911 --> 00:13:35.780
or the guy who thinks snowballs
disprove global warming

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:37.816
or the congresswoman
who wore a "censored" mask

00:13:37.816 --> 00:13:40.286
while speaking into a microphone
on television

00:13:40.286 --> 00:13:41.820
on the floor of
the United States Congress

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.122
or the senator who thinks --
and this is real --

00:13:44.122 --> 00:13:47.525
that Greenland got its name
because it used to be green.

00:13:47.525 --> 00:13:50.529
That is a real thing Wisconsin
senator Ron Johnson said.

00:13:50.529 --> 00:13:52.764
Not when he was 9, which
would have been adorable,

00:13:52.764 --> 00:13:54.767
but this month, when he told
"The New York Times"...

00:14:03.275 --> 00:14:05.210
Sure, dude, that's how Greenland
got its name.

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.946
Just like how Germany
got its name

00:14:06.946 --> 00:14:08.446
because that's where
germs come from

00:14:08.446 --> 00:14:09.882
or how Canada got its name

00:14:09.882 --> 00:14:11.750
because everyone there
loves ginger ale.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.718
And like, ha ha,
Ron Johnson's dumb.

00:14:13.718 --> 00:14:14.853
But it's worse than that.

00:14:14.853 --> 00:14:16.989
He was using
that disprovable fact

00:14:16.989 --> 00:14:18.657
to argue that climate change
isn't real

00:14:18.657 --> 00:14:20.125
because Greenland
used to be green.

00:14:20.125 --> 00:14:23.195
It wasn't just a wrong answer he
was giving on "Idiot Jeopardy."

00:14:23.195 --> 00:14:26.531
And, by the way, just a reminder
to all you pro-gun con artists

00:14:26.531 --> 00:14:28.767
once again claiming it's
the so-called radical left

00:14:28.767 --> 00:14:30.468
