everyone's gun.

00:14:30.468 --> 00:14:32.437
The most recent president

00:14:32.437 --> 00:14:34.839
who actually said we should
take people's guns away

00:14:34.839 --> 00:14:36.575
wasn't Joe Biden
or Barack Obama.

00:14:36.575 --> 00:14:37.909
It was this guy.

00:14:37.909 --> 00:14:40.545
-Allow due process so
no one's rights are trampled,

00:14:40.545 --> 00:14:43.715
but the ability to go to court,
obtain an order,

00:14:43.715 --> 00:14:45.351
