not only the firearms,

00:14:45.351 --> 00:14:47.919
but any weapons
in the possession --

00:14:47.919 --> 00:14:51.790
-Or might take the firearms
first and then go to court.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.124
Because that's another system.

00:14:53.124 --> 00:14:55.094
Because a lot of times,
by the time you go to court,

00:14:55.094 --> 00:14:57.028
it takes so long to go to court,

00:14:57.028 --> 00:15:00.532
to get the due process
procedures.

00:15:00.532 --> 00:15:02.301
I like taking the guns early.

00:15:02.301 --> 00:15:03.969
So you could do
exactly what you're saying

00:15:03.969 --> 00:15:07.272
but take the guns first,
go through due process second.

00:15:07.272 --> 00:15:08.673
-I like taking the guns early.

00:15:08.673 --> 00:15:11.243
No Democratic president
has ever even come close

00:15:11.243 --> 00:15:12.410
to saying something like that.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:13.979
And without due process,
no less.

00:15:13.979 --> 00:15:16.014
Mike Pence must have thought
he was having a fever dream.

00:15:16.014 --> 00:15:18.684
"Oh, God, someone
must have spiked my milk

00:15:18.684 --> 00:15:22.221
